tags: guest-kernel, kernel

A fact of a start: the guest kernel that the instance boots.

The value has the form of the value of the setting guest-kernel
(0e5751c026e543b2e8ab2eb06099daa1d1e5df47778f7787faab45cdf12fe3a8:f7d296919847535b01e49905681583dfe9df33650e39d4cf9d09705bd4f3c794): the ids <type>:<digest> of the bytes
of the kernel image, one for each hash type, sorted, separated by commas.

An absent fact: the node attests no kernel. The node is bound: it signs the receipt.

